sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Usuario
    participant Ctrl as ChequeraController
    participant Pub as SolicitudChequeraPublisher
    participant Kafka as Kafka (send-chequera)
    participant Listener as ChequeraEventListener
    participant Service as ChequeraService
    participant UseCase as EnviarChequeraUseCase
    participant Pref as datos/preferenciaPago
    participant Pdf as ChequeraPdfGenerator
    participant Mail as CorreoService
    participant MsgChk as datos/chequera (message check)

    User->>Ctrl: GET /sendChequera/bulk/...
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Pub: publicar(SolicitudEnvioChequera con bulk=true)
    Pub->>Kafka: evento JSON (sin __TypeId__)
    Ctrl-->>User: HTTP 202 Accepted (solicitud en proceso)
    deactivate Ctrl

    Kafka->>Listener: SendChequeraEvent
    activate Listener
    Listener->>Service: enviarChequera(solicitud)
    activate Service
    Service->>UseCase: enviar(solicitud)
    activate UseCase
    UseCase->>Pref: crearContextoBulk(...)
    activate Pref
    Pref-->>UseCase: List~PreferenciaPago~
    deactivate Pref

    UseCase->>Pdf: generarChequera(datos, codigoBarras, false)
    activate Pdf
    Pdf->>Pdf: resolver alternativas en memoria + fallback por producto
    Pdf-->>UseCase: DocumentoPdf (ruta)
    deactivate Pdf

    UseCase->>Mail: enviar(correo con adjunto)
    activate Mail
    Mail-->>UseCase: void
    deactivate Mail

    UseCase->>MsgChk: marcarEnviada + registrar message check
    activate MsgChk
    MsgChk-->>UseCase: ok
    deactivate MsgChk

    UseCase-->>Service: "Envío de Chequera Ok!!!"
    deactivate UseCase
    Service-->>Listener: resultado
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Listener
